    example: "reviewed Git revision → scheduled plan → classify drift → reconcile safe change or request approval",
    exampleNote: "A clean drift scan proves agreement at one moment; continuous controls are still needed because deployed state can change afterward.",
    mistake: "Automatically reverting every manual change without first checking whether responders made it to contain an active incident.",
    mission: "Make Git authoritative, scan at least daily, block routine console changes, auto-repair only low-risk drift, and require approval for destructive reconciliation with retained evidence.",
